    "title": "GATEWAY-batchinsertion-Create Telecom Sim Deactivate-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Telecom SIM Deactivation API facilitates the bulk deactivation of telecommunications SIM cards efficiently. Businesses can utilize this API to manage SIM deactivation in batch processes, ensuring quick and seamless updates to their customer accounts. This operation is particularly useful for telecom providers looking to streamline their service management and reduce operational overhead. Typical use cases include deactivating multiple SIMs for accounts that have been closed or during service transitions.",
